Runtime image of the argus-ledger staging container (docs/reviews/SPEC_STAGING_V0.md S1). Base and requirements are those
of ledger_py312 (same digest, same pins and hashes) plus uvicorn==0.54.0 and click==8.5.0, the newest releases whose files
were all uploaded before 2026-10-15 (two weeks or more before the build on 2026-10-29), as pure-Python wheels with their
sha256. uvicorn needs click and h11 (already pinned); its "standard" extras are not installed. Built by
scripts/build_env_from_base.sh ledger_staging; checked by scripts/check_env_image.py ledger_staging before staging may use
it. Distroless like ledger_py312: no shell, pip or git.
